{"segment_id": "segment_00004", "start": 120.0, "end": 150.0, "speech": "宾语从句，我认为啊，我失败了法语的这个考试啊，就是我挂科了啊，我没有通过。I could, 哎，出现了关键词 could。首先告诉各位一个词儿，can跟could在大部分情况下几乎可以混着用，也就是说could可以用在现在，也呃，它比can还多一个可以用在过去。更多的细节", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000011.webp", "time": 135.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学", "Can", "EXAMINATION", "ROOM", "RICHARD: I think I failed the French paper.", "I could answer sixteen of the question.", "They were very easy.", "But I couldn't answer the rest.", "They were too difficult for me.", "GARY: French tests are awful, aren't they?", "RICHARD: I hate them.", "I'm sure l've got a low mark."], "scores": [0.99144, 0.86889, 0.95236, 0.98107, 0.9749, 0.97057, 0.99824, 0.96394, 0.95953, 0.9903, 0.95799, 0.96218], "boxes": [[[1506.0, 54.0], [1635.0, 54.0], [1635.0, 90.0], [1506.0, 90.0]], [[996.0, 87.0], [1166.0, 102.0], [1157.0, 204.0], [987.0, 189.0]], [[678.0, 149.0], [849.0, 151.0], [849.0, 188.0], [678.0, 185.0]], [[691.0, 184.0], [828.0, 181.0], [829.0, 230.0], [692.0, 233.0]], [[59.0, 542.0], [1036.0, 552.0], [1036.0, 617.0], [59.0, 606.0]], [[56.0, 608.0], [941.0, 616.0], [941.0, 674.0], [56.0, 667.0]], [[61.0, 673.0], [539.0, 679.0], [538.0, 739.0], [60.0, 732.0]], [[61.0, 734.0], [743.0, 736.0], [743.0, 791.0], [61.0, 789.0]], [[60.0, 795.0], [752.0, 795.0], [752.0, 857.0], [60.0, 857.0]], [[58.0, 847.0], [1005.0, 856.0], [1005.0, 921.0], [58.0, 912.0]], [[62.0, 916.0], [586.0, 920.0], [586.0, 974.0], [62.0, 970.0]], [[56.0, 978.0], [704.0, 978.0], [704.0, 1040.0], [56.0, 1040.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
